the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt holds for *a case*.
    Merkmal 1 holds for *a case*; open textured.
    Merkmal 2 holds for *a case*; open textured.
    Merkmal 3 holds for *a case*; open textured.
    child *a number* of Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt counts for *a case*.
    Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt is decided for *a case*.
