the knowledge base r3_6_accept_delegated_operator includes:

the text of the_rulemap is at "sources/accept-delegated-operator.ruml".

child 1 of Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 1 holds for the case.

child 2 of Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 2 holds for the case.

child 3 of Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt counts for a case if
    Merkmal 3 holds for the case.

% Mindestens zwei der drei Merkmale müssen erfüllt sein
Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt holds for a case if
    Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt is decided for the case
    and a number M is the count of each N such that
        child a number N of Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt counts for the case
    and M >= 2.

Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt holds for a case if
    it is not the case that Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt is decided for the case
    and Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt would hold for the case.

Mindestens zwei Merkmale erfüllt is decided for a case if
    Merkmal 1 is decided for the case
    and Merkmal 2 is decided for the case
    and Merkmal 3 is decided for the case.

scenario generated_1 is, as stated in "accept-delegated-operator.ruml" at generated_1:
