    node_3 expects answers ["Merkmal 2 holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_3 expects answers ["it is not the case that Merkmal 2 holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    node_4 expects answers ["Merkmal 3 holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.
    not_node_4 expects answers ["it is not the case that Merkmal 3 holds for case 1"] and any unknowns.

